The Core Innovation

Bitcoin asks:

"Who owns this digital money?"

Ethereum asks:

"What can programmable ownership do?"

SOS69069 asks:

"What participation has been permanently recorded by the protocol?"

This is the fundamental difference.

SOS69069 is not designed to be another Bitcoin or another Ethereum token.

It is designed as a new category:

A blockchain protocol where ownership is replaced by verified participation, transfers are replaced by atomic mint events, and permanent history becomes the foundation of trust.
